  "description": "A former grocery bagger's tour made 232.5 million dollars.\n\nSources:\n- Wikipedia: Bad Bunny: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bad_Bunny\n\nFrom Wikipedia (Bad Bunny): after high school he worked part-time as a bagger and cashier at a supermarket while creating music; his World's Hottest Tour became the highest-grossing tour by a Latin artist in history, earning US$232.5 million by October 4, 2022; he was the most-streamed artist of the year on Spotify four times between 2020 and 2025; a Moody's Analytics estimate expected his Puerto Rico residency to have a direct economic impact of $250 million; in 2019 he and Marc Anthony donated $1.6 million to rebuild Puerto Rican baseball fields. Not financial advice.\n\n#shorts #badbunny #music #famous #howtheymakemoney",
